        "id": 1787007
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-11-26T15:59:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I wonder if the expectation is that all overrides would be reset?\n\nI think this could cause people headches when a user falls into a problem, reports a bug, someone asks \"uninstall and reinstall\" hoping this would get a clean slate whereas one of these overrides could a) be causing the bug; b) remain in place after reinstalling the app;\n\nOn top of that, I would also expect the overrides to be reset when you clear the app data but I don\u0027t know if that currently happens.",
      "revId": "e10f03bcf337eec287256e7cb7f806d402ce2434",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "ef6fa288_868697c3",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
