      },
      "lineNbr": 18,
      "author": {
        "id": 1431994
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-11-27T17:24:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Removing all overrides on uninstall is a totally valid approach, and I was considering that as well. I defer (pun intended) to the other reviewers for an opinion.\n\nJust as an aside, to get a clean plate in terms of overrides, you can use `am compat reset-all \u003cpackage_name\u003e`. Not sure doing this on app data clear makes sense, but could make sense for app uninstall.",
      "parentUuid": "33ad4672_6d193aec",
      "revId": "e10f03bcf337eec287256e7cb7f806d402ce2434",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
