      "lineNbr": 18,
      "author": {
        "id": 1010681
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-11-30T09:23:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think removing overrides on uninstall probably makes sense (but leave them in place on upgrade). There\u0027s a meta point here: we need to make sure the semantics are documented somewhere public (where are the public docs for this?)\n\nre: clear data, that also probably makes sense, but sounds like a new feature request. I think there\u0027s a broadcast for that too: ACTION_PACKAGE_DATA_CLEARED",
      "parentUuid": "ef6fa288_868697c3",
      "revId": "e10f03bcf337eec287256e7cb7f806d402ce2434",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
